KustoLoco.Geo
=============

This package contains no geo database. It reads a geo-IP dataset that you supply
at runtime. The intended dataset is the DB-IP "IP to City Lite" database.

The DB-IP Lite databases are made available by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com) under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0).

If you distribute an application that uses a DB-IP Lite dataset with this provider,
you must attribute DB-IP, for example:

    IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)

See https://db-ip.com/db/lite.php for the current license terms.

This provider reads any of the DB-IP Lite layouts — City Lite
(ip_start, ip_end, continent, country, stateprov, city, latitude, longitude), Country
Lite (ip_start, ip_end, country), or a compact country+centroid derivation
(ip_start, ip_end, country, latitude, longitude) — and any CSV using one of those column
layouts; if you use a different source, follow that source's own attribution requirements.
